{"seq":2,"slug":"stealth-tuning","title":"难度调校：在全知与全瞎之间","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-stealth-detection-systems/practice/stealth-tuning","wordCount":1901,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"难度调校-在全知与全瞎之间\">难度调校：在全知与全瞎之间</h1><p>侦测系统的代码全部写对，游戏却可能一点都不好玩——敌人调得太灵，玩家寸步难行只剩挫败；调得太钝，玩家大摇大摆如入无人之境，紧张荡然无存。潜行的乐趣栖身于两者之间一条狭窄的走廊里：敌人足够敏锐让玩家必须小心，又足够可欺让技巧和克制能奏效。找到并稳定这条走廊，靠的不是灵感而是系统化的调校。本篇讲潜行系统有哪些旋钮、怎么拧、以及用什么证据判断拧对了没有。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-暴露参数与心流走廊\">核心概念：暴露参数与心流走廊</h2><p>调校的前提是把散落在系统各处的魔法数字提炼成一组<strong>可暴露、可调、有语义的参数</strong>，而不是硬编码在逻辑里。感知层的视距 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、视野角 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、听觉半径 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、可见度各因子系数；侦测模型的上升速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mtext>gain</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_{\\text{gain}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gain</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、衰减速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mtext>decay</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_{\\text{decay}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">decay</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、衰减地板；警戒层的各状态进入/退出阈值、冷却时长；搜索层的搜索半径、时长上限、LKP 外推强度——这些共同构成系统的「调音台」。把它们集中到数据表里由设计师调（而非程序员改代码），是数据驱动设计的基本要求，其通用范式见 <a href=\"../../game-data-driven-design/\">数据驱动设计</a> 一 hub（若需）。</p>\n<p>调校的目标可以借心流理论表述：让玩家的挑战与能力大致匹配，落在「心流走廊」内——太难滑向焦虑，太易滑向无聊。这条走廊的理论属于 <a href=\"../../game-difficulty-balancing/foundations/flow-channel\">难度平衡 · 心流通道</a>，本篇关注它在潜行语境下的具体形态：潜行的挑战强度主要由「被侦测的速度」与「失误的代价」两个合力决定。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[定义目标体验&lt;br/&gt;紧张但可控] --&gt; B[暴露关键参数&lt;br/&gt;感知/侦测/警戒/搜索]&#10;  B --&gt; C[设定基线值&lt;br/&gt;凭经验或参考作品]&#10;  C --&gt; D[playtest 观察]&#10;  D --&gt; E[采集指标&lt;br/&gt;侦测率/逃脱率/卡关点]&#10;  E --&gt; F{落在心流走廊内?}&#10;  F --&gt;|太难| G[降灵敏/延冷却/增补救窗口]&#10;  F --&gt;|太易| H[提灵敏/缩衰减/加协同]&#10;  G --&gt; D&#10;  H --&gt; D&#10;  F --&gt;|是| I[锁定并做难度档变体]\">flowchart TD\n  A[定义目标体验&lt;br/&gt;紧张但可控] --&gt; B[暴露关键参数&lt;br/&gt;感知/侦测/警戒/搜索]\n  B --&gt; C[设定基线值&lt;br/&gt;凭经验或参考作品]\n  C --&gt; D[playtest 观察]\n  D --&gt; E[采集指标&lt;br/&gt;侦测率/逃脱率/卡关点]\n  E --&gt; F{落在心流走廊内?}\n  F --&gt;|太难| G[降灵敏/延冷却/增补救窗口]\n  F --&gt;|太易| H[提灵敏/缩衰减/加协同]\n  G --&gt; D\n  H --&gt; D\n  F --&gt;|是| I[锁定并做难度档变体]</pre><h2 id=\"关键旋钮及其手感效应\">关键旋钮及其手感效应</h2><p>不是所有参数对手感的影响都同等直观。有几个旋钮的效应尤其显著，值得优先关注，下表列出它们与「更难/更易」的对应关系及副作用。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>旋钮</th>\n<th>调向更难</th>\n<th>调向更易</th>\n<th>需警惕的副作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>视距 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> / 视野角 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>增大</td>\n<td>减小</td>\n<td>过大令玩家无处遁形、盲区消失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>侦测上升速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mtext>gain</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_{\\text{gain}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gain</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>提高</td>\n<td>降低</td>\n<td>过高消灭 telegraph（见反馈）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>侦测衰减速率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mtext>decay</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_{\\text{decay}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">decay</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>降低</td>\n<td>提高</td>\n<td>过低使敌人偏执、余威没完没了</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>警戒进入阈值</td>\n<td>降低</td>\n<td>提高</td>\n<td>过低造成频繁误报、区域常戒严</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降级冷却时长</td>\n<td>延长</td>\n<td>缩短</td>\n<td>过长逼玩家干等、节奏拖沓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>搜索彻底度（半径/点数/时长）</td>\n<td>提高</td>\n<td>降低</td>\n<td>过高使逃脱无望、藏无可藏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>群体协同强度</td>\n<td>增强</td>\n<td>减弱</td>\n<td>过强令警报=团灭、失公平</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键洞察是：<strong>侦测上升速率与反馈可读性直接冲突</strong>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mtext>gain</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_{\\text{gain}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">gain</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 调高会缩短从「起疑」到「确认」的窗口，而这个窗口正是玩家收到 telegraph 并补救的时间（见 <a href=\"player-feedback\">玩家反馈与可读性</a>）。所以提难度时优先动视距、协同、搜索彻底度这些不吃掉 telegraph 的旋钮，谨慎动上升速率——这是潜行调校区别于一般难度调校的特有约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"两个必须回避的失败模式\">两个必须回避的失败模式</h2><p>调校最终是在两个深渊之间走钢丝。一端是<strong>全知敌人</strong>（omniscient AI）：视距过大、上升速率过高、警报即全知玩家坐标、搜索无死角。玩家被发现后无法逃脱、无处可藏，潜行退化成「一次失误即失败」的记忆背板，挫败感极强。识别信号是 playtest 中玩家频繁在同一点死亡且抱怨「不知道怎么被发现的」。另一端是<strong>全瞎敌人</strong>（oblivious AI）：视野小得可怜、衰减快到刚转身就忘、搜索敷衍了事。玩家可以贴脸走过、无需任何技巧，紧张感为零。识别信号是玩家几乎从不进入怀疑以上状态、通关时间远短于预期。</p>\n<p>健康的系统落在中间：玩家大部分时间维持信息优势，偶尔失误后经历一段真实的紧张搜索，多数时候能凭技巧补救脱身，少数时候补救失败被迫应对后果或读档。判断落点靠指标而非感觉——下一节详述。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用指标驱动-而非凭感觉\">用指标驱动，而非凭感觉</h2><p>「感觉差不多了」是调校最危险的话。潜行系统应埋点采集客观指标，用数据判断落点。核心指标包括：<strong>侦测率</strong>（每段关卡玩家进入警觉/战斗的频次）、<strong>逃脱成功率</strong>（进入搜索后成功脱身回到不知情的比例）、<strong>补救窗口时长</strong>（从怀疑到确认的平均秒数）、<strong>卡关点热力图</strong>（玩家反复失败的具体位置）。这些指标的采集与分析属于遥测系统，其通用方法见 <a href=\"../../game-telemetry-analytics/\">游戏遥测与分析</a> 一 hub（若需）；难度层面如何读这些数字属于 <a href=\"../../game-difficulty-balancing/practice/difficulty-metrics\">难度平衡 · 难度指标</a>。</p>\n<p>用指标还能定位问题到具体参数。逃脱率过低但侦测率正常，往往是搜索太彻底或 LKP 外推太强（动搜索层）；侦测率过高但玩家抱怨「猝不及防」，是上升速率太快吃掉了 telegraph（动侦测模型 + 检查反馈）；某个位置卡关热力异常高，多半是关卡布局与感知参数的局部冲突（那片区域盲区太少），可能要改关卡而非改参数——这把调校与 <a href=\"../../level-design/foundations/player-guidance\">关卡设计</a> 连了起来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"难度档-一套系统-多种体验\">难度档：一套系统，多种体验</h2><p>同一套侦测系统要服务不同水平的玩家，靠的是<strong>难度档</strong>——用一组参数覆盖表定义「简单/普通/硬核」。简单档通常放大补救窗口（低上升速率、快衰减、短搜索）、并保留完整的显式反馈（侦测计）；硬核档收紧这些并可能移除侦测计，逼玩家靠观察。设计难度档的原则是<strong>保持系统性质不变、只缩放数值</strong>：不要在硬核档引入全知这种改变游戏规则的机制，那会越过公平红线（见 <a href=\"player-feedback\">玩家反馈与可读性</a>）。更高级的方案是动态难度调整（DDA），根据玩家实时表现悄悄拨动参数——但潜行里的 DDA 要格外克制，玩家一旦察觉敌人「因为我玩得好就变强」，信息博弈的公平前提就崩了。DDA 的通用机制见 <a href=\"../../game-difficulty-balancing/dynamic/dynamic-difficulty\">难度平衡 · 动态难度</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>调校前先把散落的魔法数字提炼成可暴露、有语义的参数调音台，交给设计师用数据表调而非改代码。</li>\n<li>目标是把「被侦测速度」与「失误代价」的合力控制在心流走廊内，太难滑向挫败、太易滑向无聊。</li>\n<li>潜行特有约束：侦测上升速率与 telegraph 可读性冲突，提难度优先动视距/协同/搜索彻底度而非上升速率。</li>\n<li>两个必须回避的深渊是全知敌人（无处可逃）与全瞎敌人（毫无紧张），健康点落在中间。</li>\n<li>用侦测率/逃脱率/补救窗口/卡关热力等客观指标定位问题到具体参数，而非凭感觉。</li>\n<li>难度档只缩放数值、不改系统性质；潜行里的 DDA 须极度克制，以免破坏公平前提。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>与之冲突的可读性约束：<a href=\"player-feedback\">玩家反馈与可读性</a>；被调的上升/衰减速率：<a href=\"../foundations/detection-model\">侦测模型</a></li>\n<li>心流走廊的理论：<a href=\"../../game-difficulty-balancing/foundations/flow-channel\">难度平衡 · 心流通道</a></li>\n<li>卡关点常需改关卡：<a href=\"../../level-design/foundations/player-guidance\">关卡设计 · 玩家引导</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"难度调校：在全知与全瞎之间","id":"难度调校-在全知与全瞎之间"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：暴露参数与心流走廊","id":"核心概念-暴露参数与心流走廊"},{"level":2,"text":"关键旋钮及其手感效应","id":"关键旋钮及其手感效应"},{"level":2,"text":"两个必须回避的失败模式","id":"两个必须回避的失败模式"},{"level":2,"text":"用指标驱动，而非凭感觉","id":"用指标驱动-而非凭感觉"},{"level":2,"text":"难度档：一套系统，多种体验","id":"难度档-一套系统-多种体验"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"玩家反馈与可读性：把黑箱翻译成玩法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-stealth-detection-systems/practice/player-feedback"},"next":{"title":"落地与边界：把系统缝进真实项目","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-stealth-detection-systems/practice/stealth-in-practice"}}